# Officer and contact forms

Keep `/compose/` and `/update/` **out of** `header_pages`. Do not add `description:` for SEO on those two (see `site-seo.mdc`). Secrets stay in Make or the typed password field (`public-site-secrets.mdc`).

## Endpoints (do not swap)

| Page | `form action` | Auth |
|---|---|---|
| `/compose/` | Make compose webhook already in `compose.html` | `secret` = `COMPOSE_SECRET` in Make |
| `/update/` | Make **update** webhook already in `update.html` | `secret` = `UPLOAD_SECRET` in Make |
| `/contact/` | FormSubmit URL already in `contact.html` | Honey pot only |

Do not reuse the compose hook on `/update/`, the update hook on compose, or either hook for Instagram RSS. Do not point Contact at Make. Scholarships stay on Jotform (`_includes/jotform.html`).

Make responds with 302 to `/compose/thanks/`, `/compose/error/`, `/update/thanks/`, `/update/error/`. Keep those permalinks.

## Concessions (Make + Sheet)

Do **not** reuse compose, update, or contact endpoints. Create a new Make webhook when the signup form is added. Officers add nights on the **Events** tab; volunteers land on **Signups**. Never commit volunteer names or emails.

Events tab / `_data/concessions-events.csv` headers:

`slug,title,sport,date,start,end,venue,adult_leads_need,adult_leads_max,published,notes`

- `venue` is `stadium` or `gym` (station lists live in `_data/concessions.yml`, not the sheet row)
- `adult_leads_need` default `1`; `adult_leads_max` default `2`
- `date` is `YYYY-MM-DD`; `published` is `true` to show on `/events/#concessions`

Signup form fields (when the form is wired):

`event_slug, station_id, adult_name, email, phone, students, comment, consent, secret`

Make compares `secret` to a concessions password in Make (typed in the form). 302 to `/events/` thanks/error permalinks once those pages exist.

## Compose (`assets/js/compose-crop.js`)

Browser crops/converts photos. Make must **not** re-crop, convert JPEGs, or remux the MP4.

- `media_kind`: `image` (one `image`, 1080×1350) · `carousel` (`images`, 2–10 at 1080×1080) · `reel` (`video` MP4 as-is)
- Keep `media_type`, `tags`, `website_only`, `social_caption`, `alt_text`
- Duplicate title the same day → tell the officer to change the title; do not overwrite

## Update lists

Each upload **replaces** the whole CSV. `kind=donors` → `_data/donors.csv`; `kind=members` → `_data/members.csv`.

Make redacts last names to an initial. Required headers: donors `first_name,last_name,amount`; members `first_name,last_name,membership_type`. Do not add columns that would publish full last names or emails.
